1
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 10]</font>

15
00:01:16,280 --> 00:01:19,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Prince Duan's Mansion]</font>

16
00:01:22,160 --> 00:01:22,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sanbai.</font>

17
00:01:23,520 --> 00:01:24,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why is it that today,</font>

18
00:01:24,080 --> 00:01:25,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there are no commoners
causing trouble at the gate?</font>

19
00:01:26,800 --> 00:01:28,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, that's right.</font>

20
00:01:29,240 --> 00:01:29,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I have no idea</font>

21
00:01:29,960 --> 00:01:31,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what is going on either.</font>

22
00:01:32,720 --> 00:01:33,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If it's okay, I'll get back to work.</font>

23
00:01:34,480 --> 00:01:34,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

24
00:01:37,240 --> 00:01:38,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yesterday, I went to clean the dungeon.</font>

25
00:01:38,640 --> 00:01:39,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I saw a pool of blood on the floor.</font>

26
00:01:40,600 --> 00:01:41,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I heard that the Prince</font>

27
00:01:41,320 --> 00:01:42,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">used torture on those</font>

28
00:01:42,720 --> 00:01:43,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">spreading gossip outside.</font>

29
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:45,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The scene was truly gruesome.</font>

30
00:01:45,760 --> 00:01:47,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince has never tortured
commoners before.</font>

31
00:01:47,760 --> 00:01:49,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To go this far for Jinyi,</font>

32
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:51,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's deeply moving.</font>

33
00:01:51,920 --> 00:01:52,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Indeed.</font>

34
00:02:02,800 --> 00:02:03,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness, please step aside.</font>

35
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:05,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm in a hurry to investigate a case.</font>

36
00:02:06,240 --> 00:02:07,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you avoiding me?</font>

37
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:10,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your mind isn't on the case anyway.</font>

38
00:02:11,480 --> 00:02:12,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What difference does it make
if you see me or not?</font>

39
00:02:24,240 --> 00:02:24,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You didn't go</font>

40
00:02:24,880 --> 00:02:26,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for treatment last night?</font>

41
00:02:26,760 --> 00:02:27,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yesterday was rather hectic.</font>

42
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:31,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What exactly
have you been busy with lately?</font>

43
00:02:31,880 --> 00:02:32,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's one thing to neglect the case,</font>

44
00:02:33,280 --> 00:02:34,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but you're neglecting
your own health too.</font>

45
00:02:36,360 --> 00:02:37,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I went to the Imperial Palace yesterday.</font>

46
00:02:38,400 --> 00:02:40,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His Majesty sent Changle
to Qingping Temple.</font>

47
00:02:41,040 --> 00:02:41,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For the time being,</font>

48
00:02:42,680 --> 00:02:43,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she won't be able to leave.</font>

49
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:45,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

50
00:02:46,080 --> 00:02:47,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did you manage that?</font>

51
00:02:49,200 --> 00:02:50,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't you say you were busy?</font>

52
00:02:51,040 --> 00:02:51,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go on, then.</font>

53
00:02:51,960 --> 00:02:52,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't keep you any longer.</font>

54
00:02:55,480 --> 00:02:56,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You do have too much free time.</font>

55
00:03:42,880 --> 00:03:44,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why has it not lessened at all?</font>

56
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:49,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

57
00:03:51,320 --> 00:03:52,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you here again?</font>

58
00:03:53,200 --> 00:03:54,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't you say you wouldn't disturb me?</font>

59
00:03:54,600 --> 00:03:56,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I heard that, for the investigation,</font>

60
00:03:56,120 --> 00:03:56,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you haven't even been eating.</font>

61
00:03:58,480 --> 00:04:00,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You always say I neglect my health.</font>

62
00:04:01,320 --> 00:04:02,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What about your health?</font>

63
00:04:05,680 --> 00:04:07,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I had tremella soup prepared for you.</font>

64
00:04:10,080 --> 00:04:10,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here.</font>

65
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:13,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have a taste.</font>

66
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:17,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just leave it there.</font>

67
00:04:18,080 --> 00:04:18,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have no appetite right now.</font>

68
00:04:23,320 --> 00:04:24,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Be careful with that.</font>

69
00:04:24,320 --> 00:04:25,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need to test it later.</font>

70
00:04:25,640 --> 00:04:26,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Eat this first.</font>

71
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:27,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I'll return it to you.</font>

72
00:04:37,760 --> 00:04:38,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is it good?</font>

73
00:04:41,160 --> 00:04:41,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's passable.</font>

74
00:04:46,360 --> 00:04:46,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">By the way,</font>

75
00:04:47,720 --> 00:04:48,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what's inside this?</font>

76
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:50,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A bat.</font>

77
00:04:50,600 --> 00:04:51,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A bat?</font>

78
00:04:52,880 --> 00:04:53,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Chief and I investigated.</font>

79
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:55,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We found that only they match</font>

80
00:04:56,800 --> 00:04:58,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">these crime characteristics:</font>

81
00:04:58,600 --> 00:04:59,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">silent fangs and nocturnal prowling.</font>

82
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:03,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As for bloodsucking...</font>

83
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:06,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give it to me.</font>

84
00:05:06,320 --> 00:05:06,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me try again.</font>

85
00:05:07,280 --> 00:05:07,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't bother.</font>

86
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:09,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This bat doesn't feed on human blood.</font>

87
00:05:11,640 --> 00:05:13,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">However, when I was at war,</font>

88
00:05:13,520 --> 00:05:14,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I once saw a kind of bat</font>

89
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:15,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that feeds solely on human blood.</font>

90
00:05:17,200 --> 00:05:17,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Truly?</font>

91
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:23,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If it's as you say,</font>

92
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:25,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">vampire bats are exceptionally rare.</font>

93
00:05:26,320 --> 00:05:28,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Transported from a distant land,</font>

94
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:30,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they wouldn't be easily destroyed.</font>

95
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:33,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now that they've lost Changle
as his contact,</font>

96
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:34,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I believe</font>

97
00:05:35,720 --> 00:05:37,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this moment must be</font>

98
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:39,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the perfect time
to destroy the evidence.</font>

99
00:05:43,480 --> 00:05:46,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Prince Duan's Mansion]</font>

100
00:05:52,920 --> 00:05:54,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone, stay sharp!</font>

101
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:57,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Search every last corner.</font>

102
00:05:59,640 --> 00:06:00,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

103
00:06:00,480 --> 00:06:01,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are we setting up so many braziers?</font>

104
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:03,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Surely, it's to...</font>

105
00:06:04,040 --> 00:06:05,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just do as I say.</font>

106
00:06:05,120 --> 00:06:06,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why so many questions?</font>

107
00:06:06,920 --> 00:06:07,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, Chief.</font>

108
00:06:16,280 --> 00:06:16,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

109
00:06:17,720 --> 00:06:18,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are</font>

110
00:06:18,960 --> 00:06:19,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">all these braziers really for?</font>

111
00:06:20,800 --> 00:06:22,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Jiang is a man of great learning.</font>

112
00:06:23,200 --> 00:06:23,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's a pity</font>

113
00:06:24,600 --> 00:06:25,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that you lack a bit of field experience.</font>

114
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:28,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll wait them out.</font>

115
00:06:29,760 --> 00:06:30,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's see who tires first.</font>

116
00:06:32,280 --> 00:06:34,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This bat fears both heat and light.</font>

117
00:06:34,880 --> 00:06:36,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Its hiding place must be cool and dark.</font>

118
00:06:38,840 --> 00:06:40,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll get there first</font>

119
00:06:40,520 --> 00:06:41,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and smoke the thing out.</font>

120
00:06:46,600 --> 00:06:47,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's just</font>

121
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:49,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as I thought.</font>

122
00:06:50,560 --> 00:06:51,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go direct them.</font>

123
00:06:57,560 --> 00:06:58,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

124
00:06:58,960 --> 00:07:00,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">last time, you mentioned</font>

125
00:07:00,280 --> 00:07:01,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Princess Changle.</font>

126
00:07:03,640 --> 00:07:04,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought you</font>

127
00:07:04,280 --> 00:07:05,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">weren't curious at all.</font>

128
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:07,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was just wondering:</font>

129
00:07:07,720 --> 00:07:08,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could someone like her</font>

130
00:07:09,320 --> 00:07:11,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">be content trapped in a temple?</font>

131
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:12,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Changle is a princess,</font>

132
00:07:13,560 --> 00:07:14,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">yet she abducted common men,</font>

133
00:07:14,640 --> 00:07:15,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">indulging in endless debauchery.</font>

134
00:07:16,280 --> 00:07:18,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She was reported to His Majesty.</font>

135
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:20,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She used public opinion to frame me.</font>

136
00:07:21,520 --> 00:07:23,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now, she's reaping what she sowed.</font>

137
00:07:23,280 --> 00:07:24,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She deserves it.</font>

138
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:25,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Actually, about your brother,</font>

139
00:07:25,560 --> 00:07:26,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I overheard everything that day.</font>

140
00:07:27,400 --> 00:07:28,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I never imagined he was still alive.</font>

141
00:07:29,640 --> 00:07:30,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Changle is as venomous as a serpent.</font>

142
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:32,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Princess Changle's Mansion
is a den of danger.</font>

143
00:07:34,640 --> 00:07:35,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You betrayed Changle for my sake.</font>

144
00:07:37,240 --> 00:07:38,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As for finding your brother,</font>

145
00:07:38,720 --> 00:07:39,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">let me help you.</font>

146
00:07:41,480 --> 00:07:42,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is a matter for my family.</font>

147
00:07:43,520 --> 00:07:44,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It has nothing to do with you.</font>

148
00:07:46,840 --> 00:07:48,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qin Wei is my wife.</font>

149
00:07:48,400 --> 00:07:49,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qin Mobai is my brother-in-law.</font>

150
00:07:51,080 --> 00:07:51,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can it not concern me?</font>

151
00:07:55,080 --> 00:07:56,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're in grave danger yourself now.</font>

152
00:07:57,200 --> 00:07:58,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Focus on the trouble at hand first.</font>

153
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:01,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The guards here are tight.</font>

154
00:08:01,840 --> 00:08:02,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's a safe place.</font>

155
00:08:03,280 --> 00:08:04,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stay here for now.</font>

156
00:08:04,680 --> 00:08:05,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take the Shadow Guards
to search the mansion.</font>

157
00:08:06,280 --> 00:08:07,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please be extremely careful.</font>

158
00:08:29,480 --> 00:08:30,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm here with the meal.</font>

159
00:08:32,440 --> 00:08:33,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's happening in the front courtyard?</font>

160
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:34,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why is there such a commotion?</font>

161
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:36,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I heard Ms. Jun</font>

162
00:08:36,520 --> 00:08:38,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">found the murder weapon.</font>

163
00:08:38,680 --> 00:08:40,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're searching the mansion now.</font>

164
00:08:40,600 --> 00:08:41,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I see.</font>

165
00:08:42,080 --> 00:08:42,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll head in now.</font>

166
00:08:43,200 --> 00:08:43,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright.</font>

167
00:08:44,240 --> 00:08:44,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go on in.</font>

168
00:08:56,520 --> 00:08:57,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Steward Zhou.</font>

169
00:09:00,840 --> 00:09:02,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, you are the real killer.</font>

170
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:08,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I never thought this day would come.</font>

171
00:09:11,080 --> 00:09:12,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince treated you well.</font>

172
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:14,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could you betray him?</font>

173
00:09:16,680 --> 00:09:18,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I came to make a deal with you.</font>

174
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:19,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun Qinglan</font>

175
00:09:20,280 --> 00:09:22,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is already searching the mansion.</font>

176
00:09:23,160 --> 00:09:23,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Soon enough,</font>

177
00:09:24,280 --> 00:09:25,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she'll follow the clues straight to me.</font>

178
00:09:27,520 --> 00:09:29,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Princess Changle's future is uncertain.</font>

179
00:09:30,960 --> 00:09:31,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't afford</font>

180
00:09:32,120 --> 00:09:34,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to throw my life away here.</font>

181
00:09:37,120 --> 00:09:38,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're a murderer.</font>

182
00:09:38,240 --> 00:09:39,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What right do you have
to bargain with me?</font>

183
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:40,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Besides,</font>

184
00:09:40,880 --> 00:09:42,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why should I agree to your terms?</font>

185
00:09:43,920 --> 00:09:45,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have no choice but to agree.</font>

186
00:09:46,240 --> 00:09:46,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because</font>

187
00:09:47,040 --> 00:09:48,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the one who let Jun Qinglan go that day</font>

188
00:09:50,120 --> 00:09:51,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was none other than you.</font>

189
00:10:03,440 --> 00:10:04,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Steward Zhou.</font>

190
00:10:04,760 --> 00:10:06,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You really know
how to keep your composure.</font>

191
00:10:08,200 --> 00:10:08,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, the one who called Jun Qinglan</font>

192
00:10:08,960 --> 00:10:10,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">into the Prince's room</font>

193
00:10:10,080 --> 00:10:11,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was also you, wasn't it?</font>

194
00:10:13,480 --> 00:10:15,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was merely following orders.</font>

195
00:10:16,840 --> 00:10:17,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jinyi,</font>

196
00:10:17,880 --> 00:10:19,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I bear you no ill will whatsoever.</font>

197
00:10:21,000 --> 00:10:21,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Moreover,</font>

198
00:10:21,800 --> 00:10:23,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Prince trusts you deeply.</font>

199
00:10:24,920 --> 00:10:26,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you can help me leave the mansion,</font>

200
00:10:27,400 --> 00:10:27,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the one</font>

201
00:10:28,400 --> 00:10:29,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who let Jun Qinglan go that day</font>

202
00:10:30,840 --> 00:10:32,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was me.</font>

203
00:10:43,680 --> 00:10:44,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Inside this box</font>

204
00:10:44,840 --> 00:10:46,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are your killing tools, right?</font>

205
00:10:51,880 --> 00:10:53,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's in here</font>

206
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:55,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">only recognizes blood,</font>

207
00:10:55,560 --> 00:10:56,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">not people.</font>

208
00:10:58,800 --> 00:11:01,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you need it, Jinyi,</font>

209
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:03,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can give it to you as well.</font>

210
00:11:06,280 --> 00:11:06,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you despise</font>

211
00:11:07,200 --> 00:11:09,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun Qinglan the most?</font>

212
00:11:09,480 --> 00:11:10,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If</font>

213
00:11:10,720 --> 00:11:11,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you leave</font>

214
00:11:12,200 --> 00:11:13,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a wound on her,</font>

215
00:11:14,240 --> 00:11:15,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">no one would be left</font>

216
00:11:15,160 --> 00:11:16,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to disturb you and the Prince, right?</font>

217
00:11:16,760 --> 00:11:17,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you take me for a fool?</font>

218
00:11:18,680 --> 00:11:19,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I trusted you,</font>

219
00:11:19,720 --> 00:11:21,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd truly be a blood-sucking demon.</font>

220
00:11:22,120 --> 00:11:23,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After you let me out of the mansion,</font>

221
00:11:24,040 --> 00:11:25,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you can easily pin her death</font>

222
00:11:26,200 --> 00:11:27,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on me.</font>

223
00:11:31,520 --> 00:11:32,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That sounds</font>

224
00:11:32,560 --> 00:11:33,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">like a fine idea.</font>

225
00:11:34,680 --> 00:11:35,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">However,</font>

226
00:11:35,760 --> 00:11:37,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have a better one.</font>

227
00:11:40,920 --> 00:11:42,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Only the dead</font>

228
00:11:42,400 --> 00:11:44,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can keep my secrets forever.</font>

229
00:12:05,320 --> 00:12:06,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is everyone from the mansion here?</font>

230
00:12:07,360 --> 00:12:09,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Steward Zhou went
to bring food to Jinyi.</font>

231
00:12:09,960 --> 00:12:11,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The rest</font>

232
00:12:11,320 --> 00:12:12,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are all here.</font>

233
00:12:12,560 --> 00:12:13,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When did he leave?</font>

234
00:12:13,760 --> 00:12:14,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A short while ago.</font>

235
00:12:20,080 --> 00:12:20,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Search the place.</font>

236
00:12:31,200 --> 00:12:32,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is that foul smell?</font>

237
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:40,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Notify the Chief at once.</font>

238
00:12:40,680 --> 00:12:41,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go!</font>

239
00:12:58,720 --> 00:12:59,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jinyi?</font>

240
00:13:17,960 --> 00:13:19,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I never suspected
the killer would be him.</font>

241
00:13:20,040 --> 00:13:21,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No wonder no one ever found out.</font>

242
00:13:21,680 --> 00:13:22,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was Steward Zhou,</font>

243
00:13:22,280 --> 00:13:23,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who's been in charge
of managing the mansion.</font>

244
00:13:24,200 --> 00:13:25,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd say if this mansion were sold,</font>

245
00:13:25,480 --> 00:13:27,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you, as its master,
would be the last to know.</font>

246
00:13:28,360 --> 00:13:29,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The bat inside is gone.</font>

247
00:13:30,640 --> 00:13:31,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go and bring Steward Zhou here.</font>

248
00:13:32,640 --> 00:13:33,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

249
00:13:33,360 --> 00:13:34,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Steward Zhou claimed
he was acting on your orders,</font>

250
00:13:34,920 --> 00:13:36,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">delivering food to Jinyi.</font>

251
00:13:36,480 --> 00:13:37,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">At that moment, I saw</font>

252
00:13:37,800 --> 00:13:38,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he was carrying a food box,</font>

253
00:13:38,760 --> 00:13:39,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so</font>

254
00:13:39,840 --> 00:13:40,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I let him go.</font>

255
00:13:40,840 --> 00:13:41,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You fool!</font>

256
00:13:41,680 --> 00:13:42,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did I not give the order</font>

257
00:13:42,400 --> 00:13:43,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that no one was to be let out?</font>

258
00:13:43,400 --> 00:13:44,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry for being incompetent.</font>

259
00:13:44,680 --> 00:13:45,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is Jun Qinglan?</font>

260
00:13:45,680 --> 00:13:46,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan left just now.</font>

261
00:13:46,720 --> 00:13:48,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She said she was going
to check Jinyi's room.</font>

262
00:13:54,720 --> 00:13:56,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I never thought the first one here</font>

263
00:13:56,200 --> 00:13:57,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would be you.</font>

264
00:14:00,440 --> 00:14:01,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Haven't you lost all your inner force?</font>

265
00:14:03,880 --> 00:14:05,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You killed Steward Zhou?</font>

266
00:14:06,560 --> 00:14:07,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He deserved to die.</font>

267
00:14:08,720 --> 00:14:09,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you want?</font>

268
00:14:10,520 --> 00:14:11,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To kill me</font>

269
00:14:11,720 --> 00:14:13,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and frame Steward Zhou for it?</font>

270
00:14:15,040 --> 00:14:15,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun Qinglan.</font>

271
00:14:16,600 --> 00:14:18,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You came to me willingly.</font>

272
00:14:18,360 --> 00:14:19,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't blame me for this.</font>

273
00:14:20,200 --> 00:14:21,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you do all this</font>

274
00:14:21,600 --> 00:14:22,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for the Prince?</font>

275
00:14:22,800 --> 00:14:23,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

276
00:14:23,680 --> 00:14:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But more because I despise you.</font>

277
00:14:26,320 --> 00:14:27,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're everywhere,</font>

278
00:14:27,680 --> 00:14:29,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">acting all high and mighty,</font>

279
00:14:29,400 --> 00:14:30,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">yet you are not worthy of the Prince.</font>

280
00:14:31,320 --> 00:14:32,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And if you kill me,</font>

281
00:14:32,800 --> 00:14:34,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'd be worthy of him?</font>

282
00:14:34,800 --> 00:14:36,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If this ever comes to light,</font>

283
00:14:36,360 --> 00:14:37,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Prince will not spare you.</font>

284
00:14:38,200 --> 00:14:40,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From the day you entered this mansion,</font>

285
00:14:40,440 --> 00:14:42,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there's no going back to the past.</font>

286
00:14:43,720 --> 00:14:46,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are the one
who shattered this peace.</font>

287
00:14:50,360 --> 00:14:51,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I were to help the Prince</font>

288
00:14:51,360 --> 00:14:52,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">eliminate a menace like you,</font>

289
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:57,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so what</font>

290
00:14:58,040 --> 00:14:59,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if it means death?</font>

291
00:15:01,680 --> 00:15:03,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is a desperate gamble.</font>

292
00:15:04,200 --> 00:15:05,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why go to such lengths?</font>

293
00:15:06,480 --> 00:15:07,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are mistaken.</font>

294
00:15:07,880 --> 00:15:09,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is burning the boats.</font>

295
00:15:10,400 --> 00:15:11,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone is gathered</font>

296
00:15:11,480 --> 00:15:13,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in the rear courtyard now.</font>

297
00:15:13,160 --> 00:15:14,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No one will come this way.</font>

298
00:15:15,080 --> 00:15:15,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Besides,</font>

299
00:15:16,880 --> 00:15:18,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it won't be me who kills you.</font>

300
00:15:19,320 --> 00:15:20,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It will be him.</font>

301
00:15:37,040 --> 00:15:39,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whether you are Qin Wei or Jun Qinglan,</font>

302
00:15:41,320 --> 00:15:43,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you will never see the Prince again.</font>

303
00:16:36,520 --> 00:16:37,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness!</font>

304
00:16:38,040 --> 00:16:38,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness!</font>

305
00:16:39,840 --> 00:16:41,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Steward Zhou is the real killer.</font>

306
00:16:41,520 --> 00:16:42,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He is trying to frame me.</font>

307
00:16:43,840 --> 00:16:44,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is Qinglan?</font>

308
00:16:44,760 --> 00:16:45,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did she not go to find you?</font>

309
00:16:46,640 --> 00:16:47,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is this not your maid?</font>

310
00:16:47,520 --> 00:16:48,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you giving her to me?</font>

311
00:16:48,720 --> 00:16:49,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sanbai.</font>

312
00:16:49,480 --> 00:16:49,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take her.</font>

313
00:16:51,600 --> 00:16:51,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go.</font>

314
00:16:51,960 --> 00:16:53,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief, why give her to me?</font>

315
00:16:53,680 --> 00:16:54,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What should I do?</font>

316
00:17:15,440 --> 00:17:15,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

317
00:17:19,240 --> 00:17:19,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

318
00:17:20,360 --> 00:17:21,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Weren't you coming to save me?</font>

319
00:17:21,920 --> 00:17:22,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have waited so long for you.</font>

320
00:17:23,880 --> 00:17:24,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

321
00:17:25,680 --> 00:17:26,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've suffered so much.</font>

322
00:17:28,680 --> 00:17:29,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come to us.</font>

323
00:17:33,920 --> 00:17:34,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

324
00:17:35,040 --> 00:17:36,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As long as I draw breath,</font>

325
00:17:36,560 --> 00:17:37,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will haunt you</font>

326
00:17:39,200 --> 00:17:40,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to the death without respite.</font>

327
00:17:41,640 --> 00:17:42,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao.</font>

328
00:17:43,400 --> 00:17:44,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now,</font>

329
00:17:45,320 --> 00:17:46,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you can't catch me anymore.</font>

330
00:17:47,140 --> 00:17:49,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

331
00:17:50,020 --> 00:17:51,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

332
00:17:51,680 --> 00:17:54,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

333
00:17:55,610 --> 00:17:59,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

334
00:18:00,290 --> 00:18:03,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

335
00:18:04,270 --> 00:18:08,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

336
00:18:08,790 --> 00:18:13,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

337
00:18:13,130 --> 00:18:18,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

338
00:18:21,260 --> 00:18:25,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

339
00:18:25,930 --> 00:18:29,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

340
00:18:29,980 --> 00:18:34,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

341
00:18:34,530 --> 00:18:37,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

342
00:18:38,510 --> 00:18:42,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

343
00:18:43,110 --> 00:18:46,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
